.TH "accuraterip-checksum" "1" "2022" ""
.SH "نام (NAME)"
accuraterip-checksum \- Compute the AccurateRip checksum of single track WAV files
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.nf
accuraterip\-checksum [\fBoptions\fP] \fI<filename>\fP \fI<track_number>\fP \fI<total_tracks>\fP
.fi
.sp
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.nf
\fB\-h\fP | \fB\-\-help\fP
.in +2
Show this help message and exit
.in -2
.fi
.sp
.nf
\fB\-\-version\fP
.in +2
Show version information
.in -2
.fi
.sp
.nf
\fB\-\-accuraterip\-v1\fP | \fB\-\-accuraterip\-v2\fP
.in +2
Explicitly choose AccurateRip checksum version (v2 is the default)
.in -2
.fi
.sp
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.sp
